-- The along form runs the same descriptors over a declared traversal order: scan(+), scan(min), and scan(-) walk pathCells 4 2 7 1, so the carry follows the path and not the row order. The masked scans beside them are the same recurrence over row order.
-- One head resolver serves scan(f) along, the glyph scans, and the folds: the last prefix of +\ is +/.
--! registry ../registries/031-scan-along.reg

--! out 2 5 9 10
scan(+) Weight along pathCells

--! out 2 2 2 1
scan(min) Weight along pathCells

--! out 2 -1 -5 -6
scan(-) Weight along pathCells

--! out 1 4 6 10
+\ Weight @ Mask

--! out 10
+/ Weight @ Mask
